                <invention-title lang="en">CUTTING BALLOON CATHETER</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A cutting balloon catheter including a balloon mounted on a distal portion of a catheter shaft. An expandable frame may be disposed over the balloon. The expandable frame may include a plurality of struts extending from a proximal end region to a distal end region. One or more cutting members may be secured to the expandable frame.</p>
